          "message": {
            "text": "Reflected XSS via Unsanitized URL in Live Chat Messages\n\nThe `linkify` function in `LiveChatTab.tsx` improperly sanitizes user-supplied URLs before inserting them into `<a>` tags within chat messages. This allows attackers to inject arbitrary HTML attributes, leading to reflected Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)."
          },
